hadiths[64]{hadithnumber,text}:
"702","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Unhey is baat ki gawahi ki taraf bulaao ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. Phir agar wo uskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah ne un par har din aur raat mein paanch namazein farz kein hain. Phir agar wo uskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah ne un par unkey maalon mein sadqa farz kya hai jo unkey maaldaaron se liya jaaeyga aur unkey faqeeron ko diya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 1395)"
"703","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey aisey amal ki khabar dijiye jo mujhey Jannat mein daakhil karey. Aap ne farmaya: Use kya hai, use kya hai. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use haajat hai. Tum Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo. Aur namaz qaem karo. Aur zakat do. Aur sila rehmi karo. (Bukhari: 1396)"
"704","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehaati Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Mujhey aisey amal ki raah dikhaaeye ke jab main use karun to Jannat mein daakhil hun. Aap ne farmaya: Tum Allah ki ibaadat karo, uskey sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo. Aur farz namaz qaem karo. Aur farz zakat ada karo. Aur Ramazan key rozey rakkho. Us ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Main is par zyada na karunga. Phir jab wo peeth mor kar gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jisko khushi ho ke wo Jannat walon mein se aadmi ko dekhey to use isey dekhna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 1397)"
"705","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey aur Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) (khaleefa) huey aur Arbon mein se jo kaafir hua kaafir hua. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tum logon se kaisey qitaal kartey ho jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo kahein: La ilaaha illallah. Phir jo use kahey to us ne mujh se apna maal aur apni jaan mehfooz kar li magar uskey haq key sath. Aur uska hisaab Allah par hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor us se qitaal karunga jo namaz aur zakat key darmiyaan farq karey. Beshak zakat maal ka haq hai. Aur Allah ki qasam! Agar unhon-ne mujh se bakri ka bachcha rok liya jo wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko detey they to main un se uskey rokney par qitaal karunga. Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Wo sirf ye tha ke Allah ne Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ka seena qitaal key liye khol diya tha. To main ne jaan liya ke wo haq hai. (Bukhari: 1339, 1400)"
"706","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Oont apne maalik key paas sab se achhi haalat mein aaengey jab wo us mein uska haq na dey. Wo use apne khuron se raundengey. Aur bakriyaan apne maalik key paas sab se achhi haalat mein aaengi jab wo us mein uska haq na dey. Wo use apne khuron se raundengi aur apne seengon se maarengi. Aur farmaya: Aur unka haq mein se hai ke unhey paani par doha jaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tum mein se koi Qiyaamat key din bakri ley kar na aaey jabke wo use apni gardan par uthaaey huey ho aur uski aawaaz ho. To wo kahey: Ya Muhammad! To main kahunga: Main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh nahi rakhta. Main ne pahuncha diya tha. Aur na oont ley kar aaey jabke wo use apni gardan par uthaaey huey ho aur uski aawaaz ho. To wo kahey: Ya Muhammad! To main kahunga: Main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh nahi rakhta. Main ne pahuncha diya tha. (Bukhari: 1402)"
"707","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jisey Allah ne maal diya aur us ne uski zakat na di to Qiyaamat key din uska maal uskey liye ganjey saanp banaaya jaaeyga jiskey (aankhon par) do nishaan hongey. Use Qiyaamat key din usey haar pehnaaya jaaeyga. Phir uskey donon jabdey pakdega, yaani uskey donon gaal, phir kahega: Main tumhara maal hun, main tumhara khazaana hun. Phir tilaawat ki: (Wo jo bakheeli kartey hain gumaan na karein) aayat. (Bukhari: 1403)"
"708","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch ooqiya se kam mein sadqa nahi hai. Aur paanch oonton se kam mein sadqa nahi hai. Aur paanch wasaq se kam mein sadqa nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1405)"
"709","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajoor key baraabar paak kamaai se sadqa karey, aur Allah paak key siwa qabool nahi karta. Aur beshak Allah use apne daaen (haath) se qabool karta hai, phir use uskey maalik key liye paalta hai jaisey tum mein se koi apne bachhdey ko paalta hai yahan tak ke wo pahaad jaisa ho jaata hai. (Bukhari: 1410)"
"710","[AI-translation] Haaritha bin Wahb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Sadqa karo. Beshak tum par zamaana aaeyga ke aadmi apna sadqa ley kar chalega aur use qabool karney wala na paaeyga. Aadmi kahega: Agar tum use kal laatey to main qabool kar leta. Lekin aaj mujhey uski haajat nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1411)"
"711","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum mein maal bahut ho jaey aur behney lagey. Yahan tak ke maal key maalik ko fikr hogi ke uska sadqa kaun qabool karey. Aur yahan tak ke use pesh karey aur jis par use pesh karey wo kahey: Mujhey haajat nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1412)"
"712","[AI-translation] Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas tha. To Aap key paas do aadmi aey. Un mein se aik tangdasti ki shikaayat karta tha aur doosra raah katney ki shikaayat karta tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raah katney ka to ye haal hai ke tum par thodi muddat key siwa na aaeygi yahan tak ke qaafila Makkah ki taraf baghair muhaafiz key niklega. Aur tangdasti ka to ye haal hai ke Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum mein se koi apna sadqa ley kar phireyga aur use us se qabool karney wala na milega. Phir tum mein se koi Allah key saamney khada hoga jabke uskey aur uskey darmiyaan parda na hoga aur na tarjumaan jo uskey liye tarjuma karey. Phir wo us se zaroor kahega: Kya main ne tumhey maal nahi diya tha? To wo zaroor kahega: Kyun nahi. Phir wo zaroor kahega: Kya main ne tumhaari taraf Rasool nahi bheja tha? To wo zaroor kahega: Kyun nahi. To wo apne daaen taraf dekhega aur aag key siwa kuchh na dekhega. Phir apne baaen taraf dekhega aur aag key siwa kuchh na dekhega. To tum mein se koi aag se bachey agarchey khajoor key tukdey se. Phir agar na paaey to achhi baat se. (Bukhari: 1413)"
"713","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Logon par zamaana zaroor aaeyga ke aadmi us mein soney ka sadqa ley kar phireyga. Phir use koi na paaeyga jo use us se ley. Aur aik aadmi dekha jaaeyga ke uskey peechey chaalees auratein chalengi jo us se chipakti hongi, mardon ki kami aur auraton ki zyaadti ki wajah se. (Bukhari: 1414)"
"714","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab hamein sadqey ka hukm detey to ham mein se koi baazaar ki taraf jaata aur mazdoori karta aur mud paata. Aur beshak un mein se baaz key paas aaj laakh hai. (Bukhari: 1416)"
"715","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aurat apni do betiyon key sath maangtey huey daakhil hui. To us ne merey paas khajoor key siwa kuchh na paaya. To main ne use usey dey diya. To us ne use apni donon betiyon key darmiyaan taqseem kar diya aur us mein se na khaaya. Phir khadi hui aur nikal gai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey paas daakhil huey aur main ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo in betiyon se kisi aazmaish mein daala gaya to wo uskey liye aag se parda hongi. (Bukhari: 1418)"
"716","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaunsa sadqa ajr mein sab se bada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum sadqa karo jabke tum tandrust aur harees ho, faqr se dartey ho aur maal-daari ki ummeed rakhtey ho. Aur mohlat na do yahan tak ke jab (jaan) halq tak pahunchay to kaho: Fulaan key liye itna aur fulaan key liye itna, jabke wo fulaan ka ho chuka hai. (Bukhari: 1419)"
"717","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baaz biwiyon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Ham mein se tum se milney mein sab se jaldi kaun hogi? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein sab se lambey haath wali. To unhon-ne sarkaanda liya aur use naapney lagein. To Sauda sab se lambey haath wali thein. To ham ne baad mein jaana ke uskey haath ki lambaai sadqa thi. Aur wo ham mein sab se jaldi Aap se milne wali thein aur wo sadqa pasand karti thein. (Bukhari: 1420)"
"718","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Main zaroor sadqa karunga. To wo apna sadqa ley kar nikla aur use chor key haath mein rakkha. To subah huey aur baat karney lagey: Chor ko sadqa diya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah terey liye hamd hai! Main zaroor sadqa karunga. To wo apna sadqa ley kar nikla aur use zaaniya key donon haathon mein rakkha. To subah huey aur baat karney lagey: Aaj raat zaaniya ko sadqa diya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah terey liye hamd hai, zaaniya par! Main zaroor sadqa karunga. To wo apna sadqa ley kar nikla aur use maaldaar key donon haathon mein rakkha. To subah huey aur baat karney lagey: Maaldaar ko sadqa diya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah terey liye hamd hai, chor par aur zaaniya par aur maaldaar par! To uskey paas (farishta) aaya aur us se kaha gaya: Lekin chor par tumhaara sadqa, shayed wo apni chori se bachey. Aur zaaniya to shayed wo apne zina se bachey. Aur maaldaar to shayed wo ibrat paaey aur us mein se kharch karey jo Allah ne use diya hai. (Bukhari: 1421)"
"719","[AI-translation] Maan bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baiat ki, main aur merey waalid aur merey daada ne. Aur Aap ne merey liye (nikah ka) paighaam diya aur mera nikaah karaaya. Aur main ne Aap ki taraf jhagda pesh kya. Aur merey waalid Yazeed ne deenaar nikaaley taake unhey sadqa karein. To unhey masjid mein aik aadmi key paas rakkha. To main aaya aur unhey liya aur unhey ley kar uskey paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne tumhara iraada nahi kya tha. To main ne us se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf jhagda kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumharey liye wo hai jo tum ne niyat ki ae Yazeed! Aur tumharey liye wo hai jo tum ne liya ae Maan! (Bukhari: 1422)"
"720","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne ghar key khaaney mein se kharch karey baghair fasaad kiye to usey uskey kharch ka ajr hai jo us ne kharch kya. Aur uskey shohar ko uskey kamaaney ka ajr hai jo us ne kamaaya. Aur khaazin ko us jaisa. Un mein se koi kisi key ajr mein kuchh kami nahi karta. (Bukhari: 1425)"
"721","[AI-translation] Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Upar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Aur us se shuru karo jiska tum kharch uthaatey ho. Aur behtareen sadqa beniyaazi key sath hai. Aur jo paakdaamani chaahaaey to Allah use paakdaaman bana dega. Aur jo beniyaaz hona chaahaaey to Allah use beniyaaz kar dega. (Bukhari: 1428)"
"722","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jabke Aap mimbar par they aur sadqey aur paakdaamani aur maangney ka zikr kya: Upar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. To upar wala haath kharch karney wala hai aur neechey wala maangney wala hai. (Bukhari: 1429)"
"723","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Aap key paas maangney wala aata ya Aap se haajat maangi jaati to farmatey: Sifaarish karo, ajr diye jaaogey. Aur Allah apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zabaan par jo chaahega faisla karega. (Bukhari: 1432)"
"724","[AI-translation] Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Baandh kar na rakkho, tum par baandh diya jaaeyga. Aur aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ginn kar na rakkho, Allah tum par ginn kar deyga. (Bukhari: 1433)"
"725","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jama kar key na rakkho, Allah tum par jama kar key deyga. Kharch karo jitni taaqat rakhteen ho. (Bukhari: 1433)"
"726","[AI-translation] Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bataaiye aisi cheezein jinhey main jaahiliyat mein neki samajh kar karta tha, sadqey ya ghulaam aazaad karney aur sila rehmi mein se. To kya un mein ajr hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne pehli bhalai key sath Islam qabool kya hai. (Bukhari: 1436)"
"727","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman amaanatdaar khaazin jo poora aur mukammal aur khush dil se dey jo use hukm diya gaya, aur use usey dey jiskey liye use hukm diya gaya, do sadqa denay walon mein se aik hai. (Bukhari: 1438)"
"728","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi din nahi jis mein bandey subah kartey hain magar do farishtey utartey hain. To un mein se aik kehta hai: Ae Allah! Kharch karney waley ko badla dey. Aur doosra kehta hai: Ae Allah! Rokney waley ko tabaahi dey. (Bukhari: 1442)"
"729","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bakheel aur sadqa denay waley ki misaal do aadmiyon jaisi hai jin par seenon se halkon tak lohey key jubbaat hon. Lekin kharch karney wala to kharch nahi karta magar (jubba) phailta hai ya uski jild par bharta hai yahan tak ke uski ungliyaan chhupa dey aur uska nishaan mita dey. Aur bakheel to kuchh kharch karna nahi chaahta magar har kadi apni jagah chipak jaati hai. To wo use kushaada karta hai aur wo kushaada nahi hota. (Bukhari: 1444)"
"730","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqa hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Phir jo na paaey? Aap ne farmaya: Apne haath se kaam karey aur apne aap ko faeda dey aur sadqa karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir agar na paaey? Aap ne farmaya: Haajatmand beqaraar ki madad karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir agar na paaey? Aap ne farmaya: Use neki karni chaahiye aur buraai se rukna chaahiye. Beshak wo uskey liye sadqa hai. (Bukhari: 1445)"
"731","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nusaiba Ansaariya ki taraf bakri bheji gai. To us ne Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf us mein se bheji. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumharey paas kuchh hai? To main ne kaha: Nahi, magar jo Nusaiba ne us bakri mein se bheji hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Laao, beshak wo apne thikaaney tak pahunch gai hai. (Bukhari: 1446)"
"732","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey wo likha jo Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm diya tha: Aur jiskey sadqey mein bint-e-makhaaz tak pahunchey aur uskey paas (wo) na ho aur uskey paas bint-e-laboon ho to wo us se qabool ki jaaeygi aur sadqa lenay wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyaan dega. Phir agar uskey paas chehrey par bint-e-makhaaz na ho aur uskey paas ibn-e-laboon ho to wo us se qabool kya jaaeyga aur uskey sath kuchh nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1448)"
"733","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey wo likha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farz kya tha: Aur juda juda ko khauf-e-sadqa se jama na kya jaey aur na jama ko juda kya jaey. (Bukhari: 1450)"
"734","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey wo likha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farz kya tha: Aur jo do shareekon mein se ho to wo donon aapas mein baraabari se rujoo karengey. (Bukhari: 1451)"
"735","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehaati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hijrat key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Afsos tum par! Beshak uska muamla sakht hai. To kya tumharey paas oont hain jinka tum sadqa detey ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To samandaron key peechey amal karo, beshak Allah tumharey amal mein se kuchh kam na karega. (Bukhari: 1452)"
"736","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey sadqey ka fareeza likha jo Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm diya tha: Jiskey paas oonton mein jaza key sadqey tak pahunchey aur uskey paas jazaa na ho aur uskey paas hiqqa ho to us se hiqqa qabool kya jaaeyga aur uskey sath do bakriyaan deyga agar usey aasaan hon ya bees dirham. Aur jiskey paas hiqqa key sadqey tak pahunchey aur uskey paas hiqqa na ho aur uskey paas jazaa ho to us se jazaa qabool kya jaaeyga aur sadqa lenay wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyaan dega. Aur jiskey paas hiqqa key sadqey tak pahunchey aur uskey paas bint-e-laboon key siwa na ho to us se bint-e-laboon qabool ki jaaeygi aur wo do bakriyaan ya bees dirham dega. Aur jiskey sadqey mein bint-e-laboon tak pahunchey aur uskey paas hiqqa ho to us se hiqqa qabool kya jaaeyga aur sadqa lenay wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyaan dega. Aur jiskey sadqey mein bint-e-laboon tak pahunchey aur uskey paas (wo) na ho aur uskey paas bint-e-makhaaz ho to us se bint-e-makhaaz qabool kya jaaeyga aur uskey sath bees dirham ya do bakriyaan deyga. (Bukhari: 1453)"
"737","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey ye kitaab likhi jab unhey Bahrein ki taraf bheja: Allah key naam se jo bada Meherbaan Nihayat Rehem wala hai. Ye sadqey ka fareeza hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Musalmaanon par farz kya. Aur jo Allah ne apne Rasool ko hukm diya: Phir jis Musalman se use uskey chehrey par maanga jaey to use dena chaahiye. Aur jis se us se zyada maanga jaey to na dey. Chaubees oonton mein aur us se neechey bakriyon mein se har paanch mein bakri hai. Jab pachees se paintis tak pahunchey to us mein maada bint-e-makhaaz hai. Phir jab chhattis se paintaalees tak pahunchey to us mein maada bint-e-laboon hai. Phir jab chhiyaalees se saaath tak pahunchey to us mein hiqqa hai jo oont ki jawaani ko pahunchi hui hai. Phir jab iksaath se pichhattar tak pahunchey to us mein jazaa hai. Phir jab, yaani chhihattar se nabbe tak pahunchey to us mein do bint-e-laboon hain. Phir jab ikyaanbe se aik sau bees tak pahunchey to us mein do hiqqa hain jo oont ki jawaani ko pahunchi hui hain. Phir jab aik sau bees se zyada hon to har chaalees mein bint-e-laboon hai. Aur har pachaas mein hiqqa hai. Aur jiskey paas chaar oonton key siwa na hon to us mein sadqa nahi hai magar ye ke uska maalik chaahe. Phir jab paanch oont tak pahunchey to us mein bakri hai. Aur bakriyon key sadqey mein charney waliyon mein jab chaalees se aik sau bees tak hon to bakri hai. Phir jab aik sau bees se do sau tak zyada hon to do bakriyaan hain. Phir jab do sau se teen sau tak zyada hon to us mein teen bakriyaan hain. Phir jab teen sau se zyada hon to har sau mein bakri hai. Phir jab aadmi ki charney wali chaalees bakriyon se aik bakri kam ho to us mein sadqa nahi hai magar ye ke uska maalik chaahe. Aur chaandi mein chauthaai ushri hai. Phir agar aik sau nabbe key siwa na hon to us mein kuchh nahi hai magar ye ke uska maalik chaahe. (Bukhari: 1454)"
"738","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey wo sadqa likha jo Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm diya tha: Aur sadqey mein budhi aur aib wali aur bakra na nikaala jaey magar jo sadqa lenay wala chaahe. (Bukhari: 1455)"
"739","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) key Yaman bhejaney ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: Beshak tum Ahle Kitaab qaum key paas jaa rahey ho. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki, phir uskey aakhir mein farmaya: Aur logon key qeemti maalon se bacho. (Bukhari: 1458)"
"740","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha Madina mein khajooron se Ansaar mein sab se zyada maal waley they. Aur unkey maalon mein unhey sab se mehboob Bairuha tha. Aur wo masjid key saamney tha. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us mein daakhil hotey aur us mein umda paani peetey. Anas ne kaha: Phir jab ye aayat naazil hui: (Tum neki ko na paaogey yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand kartey ho), to Abu Talha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf uthay aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah farmaata hai: (Tum neki ko na paaogey yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand kartey ho). Aur beshak merey maalon mein mujhey sab se mehboob Bairuha hai. Aur beshak wo Allah key liye sadqa hai, main uski neki aur Allah key paas uskey zakheera honay ki ummeed rakhta hun. To use Ya Rasulullah jahaan Allah tumhey dikhaaey rakkho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waah! Wo faeda mand maal hai! Wo faeda mand maal hai! Aur beshak main ne jo tum ne kaha suna hai. Aur beshak main dekhta hun ke tum use qareebi rishtedaaron mein rakkho. To Abu Talha ne kaha: Main karunga Ya Rasulullah! To Abu Talha ne use apne rishtedaaron aur chacha zaad bhaiyon mein taqseem kar diya. (Bukhari: 1461)"
"741","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unki Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key Eidgaah ki taraf nikalney mein hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: Phir jab Aap apne ghar tashreef laaey to Ibn Masood ki biwi Zainab Aap par ijazat maangtey huey aaein. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Zainab hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaunsi Zainabein? To kaha gaya: Ibn Masood ki biwi. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, unhey ijazat do. To unhey ijazat di gai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Beshak Aap ne aaj sadqey ka hukm diya hai. Aur merey paas mera zewar tha aur main ne chaaha ke main use sadqa karun. To Ibn Masood ne gumaan kya ke wo aur uska beta zyada haqdaar hain jinko main sadqa karun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Masood ne sach kaha. Tumhara shohar aur tumhara beta zyada haqdaar hain jinko tum sadqa karo. (Bukhari: 1462)"
"742","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman par uskey ghodey aur uskey ghulaam mein sadqa nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1463)"
"743","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din mimbar par baithey aur ham Aap key gird baithey. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tum par apne baad us se darta hun jo tum par duniya ki raunaq aur uski zeenat mein se khola jaaeyga. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya bhalai buraai laaeygi? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaamosh rahey. To us se kaha gaya: Tumhara kya haal hai ke tum Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat kartey ho aur wo tum se baat nahi kartey? To ham ne dekha ke Aap par (wahi) naazil ho rahi hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne us se paseena ponchha. To farmaya: Poochhney wala kahaan hai? Aur goya Aap ne uski tareef ki. To farmaya: Beshak bhalai buraai nahi laati. Aur beshak jo bahaar ugaati hai wo maarta hai ya qareeb karta hai. Magar sabza khaanay wala: Us ne khaaya yahan tak ke jab uski donon kokhein phail gaein to us ne sooraj ki taraf munh kya aur gobar kya aur peshaab kya aur chara. Aur beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai. To Musalman ka achha saathi wo hai jo us mein se miskeen aur yateem aur musaafir ko dey. Ya jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya. Aur beshak jo use naahaq ley to us jaisa hai jo khaata hai aur ser nahi hota. Aur wo Qiyaamat key din us par gawaah hoga. (Bukhari: 1465)"
"744","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood ki biwi Zainab (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unki hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: To main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf gai aur Ansaar ki aik aurat ko darwaazey par paaya jiski haajat meri haajat jaisi thi. To hamarey paas se Bilaal guzrey. To ham ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochho: Kya meri taraf se kaafi hoga ke main apne shohar aur apne yateemon par kharch karun jo meri god mein hain? To us ne Aap se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Haan, usey do ajr hain: Rishtedaari ka ajr aur sadqey ka ajr. (Bukhari: 1466)"
"745","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya merey liye ajr hai ke main Abi Salma key beton par kharch karun? Beshak wo merey betey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Un par kharch karo, tumhey uska ajr hai jo tum ne un par kharch kya. (Bukhari: 1467)"
"746","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sadqey ka hukm diya. To kaha gaya: Ibn Jameel aur Khaalid bin Waleed aur Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib ne rok diya hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Jameel ko kya naaraazgi hai magar ye ke wo faqueer tha aur Allah aur uskey Rasool ne use maaldaar kar diya. Aur Khaalid ka to ye haal hai ke tum Khaalid par zulm kartey ho. Beshak us ne apni zirahein aur hathiyaar Allah key raastey mein rok rakkhey hain. Aur Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key chacha hain. To wo us par sadqa hai aur uskey sath us jaisa. (Bukhari: 1468)"
"747","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar mein se logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga aur Aap ne unhey diya. Phir unhon-ne Aap se maanga aur Aap ne unhey diya. Phir unhon-ne Aap se maanga aur Aap ne unhey diya. Yahan tak ke jo Aap key paas tha khatm ho gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo bhalai merey paas hogi to main use tum se bacha kar na rakkhunga. Aur jo paakdaamani chaahaaey to Allah use paakdaaman bana dega. Aur jo beniyaaz hona chaahaaey to Allah use beniyaaz kar dega. Aur jo sabr karey to Allah use sabr deyga. Aur kisi ko sabr se behtar aur kushaada ataa nahi diya gaya. (Bukhari: 1469)"
"748","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum mein se koi apni rassi ley aur apni peeth par lakdi jama karey ye uskey liye behtar hai is se ke wo aadmi key paas aaey aur us se maangey, wo use dey ya rok ley. (Bukhari: 1470)"
"749","[AI-translation] Aur Zubair bin Awwaam (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik riwayat mein hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni rassi ley aur apni peeth par lakdi ka gaththa laa kar bechey aur Allah uskey sath uska chehra (sawaal se) bacha ley ye uskey liye behtar hai is se ke wo logon se maangey, wo use dein ya rok lein. (Bukhari: 1471)"
"750","[AI-translation] Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga aur Aap ne mujhey diya. Phir main ne Aap se maanga aur Aap ne mujhey diya. Phir main ne Aap se maanga aur Aap ne mujhey diya. Phir farmaya: Ae Hakeem! Beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai. To jo use nafs ki sakhaawat key sath ley uskey liye us mein barkat di jaaeygi. Aur jo use nafs ki hirs key sath ley uskey liye us mein barkat na di jaaeygi. Us jaisa hai jo khaata hai aur ser nahi hota. Upar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Hakeem ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Main tumharey baad kisi se kuchh na lunga yahan tak ke duniya se juda hun. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) Hakeem ko ataa ki taraf bulaatey aur wo us se qabool karney se inkaar kartey. Phir Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne use denay key liye bulaaya aur us ne us se kuchh qabool karney se inkaar kya. To Umar ne kaha: Beshak main tumhey gawaah banaata hun ae Musalmaanon ki jamaat Hakeem par ke main usey is maal-e-fai mein se uska haq pesh karta hun aur wo use lenay se inkaar karta hai. To Hakeem ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baad logon mein se kisi se kuchh na liya yahan tak ke wo faut ho gaey. (Bukhari: 1472)"
"751","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey ataa detey they. To main kehta: Use dijiye jo mujh se zyada uska mohtaaj hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use lo. Jab tumharey paas is maal mein se kuchh aaey jabke tum hirs na rakhtey ho aur na maangtey ho to use lo. Aur jo na ho to uskey peechey apne aap ko na lagaao. (Bukhari: 1473)"
"752","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi musalsal logon se maangta rehta hai yahan tak ke Qiyaamat key din aaeyga jabke uskey chehrey mein gosht ka tukda na hoga. (Bukhari: 1474)"
"753","[AI-translation] Aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak sooraj Qiyaamat key din qareeb hoga yahan tak ke paseena aadhey kaan tak pahunchega. Phir jabke wo aise hongey to wo Aadam se phir Musa se phir Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se madad maangengey. (Bukhari: 1475)"
"754","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi hai jo logon par phirta hai jisey aik luqma aur do luqmaey aur aik khajoor aur do khajoorein wapas kar dein. Lekin miskeen wo hai jo beniyaazi na paaey jo use beniyaaz karey aur na pehchaana jaey ke us par sadqa kya jaey aur na khada ho kar logon se maangey. (Bukhari: 1479)"
"755","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jisey aasmaan aur chashmon ne pilaaya ya baarish ka paani milney wala ho us mein daswaan hissa hai. Aur jo paani dey kar seerab kya gaya us mein beeswaan hissa hai. (Bukhari: 1483)"
"756","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Khajoor todney key waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas khajoor laai jaati thi. To ye apni khajoor ley kar aata aur ye apni khajoor mein se. Yahan tak ke Aap key paas khajoor ka dher ho jaata. To Hasan aur Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) us khajoor se khelney lagey. To un mein se aik ne khajoor li aur use apne munh mein rakkha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski taraf dekha aur use uskey munh se nikaala aur farmaya: Kya tum nahi jaantey ke Aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sadqa nahi khaatey. (Bukhari: 1485)"
"757","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Allah key raastey mein ghodey par sawaar kya. To jiskey paas tha us ne use zaaya kar diya. To main ne chaaha ke use khareed lun aur mera khayaal tha ke wo use sastey bechega. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use na khareedo aur apne sadqey mein wapas na aao agarchey wo use tumhey dirham key badley dey. Beshak apne sadqey mein wapas aaney wala us jaisa hai jo apni qay mein wapas aata hai. (Bukhari: 1490)"
"758","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mari hui bakri paai jo Maimoona ki aazaad karda londi ko sadqey mein di gai thi. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne uski khaal se faeda kyun na uthaaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak wo murdaar hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak uska khaana haraam kya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 1492)"
"759","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gosht laaya gaya jo Barira ko sadqey mein diya gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo us par sadqa hai aur wo hamaarey liye tohfa hai. (Bukhari: 1495)"
"760","[AI-translation] Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees aur unkey Yaman bhejaney ki guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: Aur mazloom ki baddua se bacho, beshak uskey aur Allah key darmiyaan parda nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1496)"
"761","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Aap key paas qaum apna sadqa laati to farmatey: Ae Allah! Fulaan key ghar walon par rehmat bhej. To merey waalid Aap key paas apna sadqa laaey. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Abu Aufa key ghar walon par rehmat bhej. (Bukhari: 1497)"
"762","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Bani Israel mein se aik aadmi ne Bani Israel mein se baaz se maanga ke wo use hazaar deenaar qarz dey. To us ne use usey dey diye. To wo samandar mein nikla aur sawaari na paai. To us ne lakdi li aur use khokhla kya aur us mein hazaar deenaar daakhil kiye aur use samandar mein phenk diya. To wo aadmi nikla jis ne use qarz diya tha aur lakdi (paai). To use apne ghar walon key liye lakdi key liye liya, to hadees zikr ki, phir jab us ne use cheera to maal paaya. (Bukhari: 1498)"
"763","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Be-zabaan (jaanwar ka nuqsaan) muaf hai. Aur kuwein (ka nuqsaan) muaf hai. Aur khadaan (ka nuqsaan) muaf hai. Aur dafan khazaaney mein paanchwaan hissa hai. (Bukhari: 1499)"
"764","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Asad mein se aik aadmi ko Bani Sulaim key sadqon par muqarrar kya jo Ibn-ul-Lutbiya kehlaatey they. Phir jab wo aaya to us se hisaab liya. (Bukhari: 1500)"
"765","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Abi Talha ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas subah ley gaya taake Aap usey ghutti dein. To main Aap key paas pahuncha jabke Aap key haath mein daaghney ka aala tha, Aap sadqey key oonton ko daagh rahey they. (Bukhari: 1502). Sadqa-e-Fitr ki kitaab."
